---
title: M-Ranked — cache invalidation
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as Collector / admin writer
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant A as FastAPI
    participant L as bounded in-process LRU
    participant C as Browser / Next.js

    W->>PG: BEGIN; write canonical rows
    W->>PG: INSERT dataset_revision and outbox_event
    W->>PG: COMMIT
    PG-->>A: NOTIFY cache_invalidated(revision)
    A->>L: clear affected local entries
    A->>PG: mark outbox delivered with outbox_worker role

    C->>A: GET bounded resource
    A->>PG: read latest dataset revision
    A->>L: GET revision + canonical query key
    alt cache hit
        L-->>A: response
    else cache miss
        A->>PG: live bounded SELECT
        PG-->>A: rows
        A->>L: PUT with TTL
    end
    A-->>C: JSON + ETag + Cache-Control

    opt NOTIFY lost
        Note over A,L: revision changes the key and TTL bounds stale data.
    end
